   <narrative xml:lang="EN">People Center for Development and Peace</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aims at strengthening communities in Cambodia to engage effectively with local and national governments, promote rights, gender equality and socio-economic development, and minimise alcohol-related harm. Targeting youth, women, LGBTQI+ and community members, the project aims to reach 26,000 people directly, with a focus on empowering women and youth and fostering cooperation between youth networks, civil society and sub-national authorities. Activities include policy advocacy, awareness-raising campaigns, trainings and workshops across seven provinces.</narrative>
  </description>
